      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i like the idea of them looking worn down. to make it even more immersive though, i want to get into more specific physical details. when the characters are in a crowd, what kind of facial features or hair textures would differentiate them from the High-Tier? like, instead of just being 'dirty', can we give them more specific ethnic or biological markers that suggest they come from a different lineage or a more 'primitive' or 'rugged' background compared to the polished, more refined looks of the elites?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
