    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. to really hammer home that sense of being \"different\" or \"unrefined,\" i want to look at their social behaviors and cultural vibes too. when they hang out in their own neighborhoods, what kind of cultural habits or \"vices\" would they have? like, instead of the refined, quiet, or intellectual behaviors of the High-Tier, what are some more raw, perhaps even \"uncontrolled\" or \"aggressive\" ways the Low-Tier might express themselves or bond together? i want to avoid making them just \"sad workers\" and make them feel like they have a completely different, maybe even more volatile, social DNA.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
