      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The Low-Tier communities could bond through loud, visceral displays of camaraderie, involving rough physical contact, aggressive banter, and shared, low-brow entertainment like chaotic street gatherings or illicit, high-energy rituals. Their cultural expressions might revolve around immediate gratification and raw emotional release, contrasting sharply with the High-Tier's measured, controlled interactions. They might develop a strong, almost tribal sense of loyalty to their immediate group, expressing defiance through volatile outbursts rather than quiet dissent.",
